  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal, due to its symmetrical front features and choice of integrated approach on both sides and at roof level, would fail to relate sympathetically or subordinately to the main dwelling appearing as an overly dominant and incongruous addition on the front elevation and streetscene, resulting in significant and unacceptable harm to the character and appearance of the existing dwelling and the 'Burton Estates' Area of Special Local Character (ASLC) streetscene, characterised with well-established asymmetrical front appearances of the houses. As such, the proposal is contrary to Policy 28 and 30 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and the guidance contained in the Council's Supplementary Planning Document 4 'Design of Residential Extensions' (SPD4) and 'The Burton Estates ASLC - Character Appraisal'."
  ],
